            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "The sequel to Inferno+, Radiangames' critically-acclaimed twin-stick action-RPG, arrives on PC at last! INFERNO 2 boasts even more devious levels, more weapons, more upgrades and powers, more enemies, and more customization, along with more insane explosions and particle effects.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBIGGER, BETTER, BADDER! Inferno 2 on PC is everything Radiangames fans have been waiting for:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Play through 80+ levels of atmospheric awesomeness<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* New Game+ mode adds even more replayability<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Customizable gamepad and KB/mouse controls<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* 3 difficulty levels (change it up at any time)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Dozens of enemy types<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* All-new special level types and goals<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Tons of secrets to discover<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* A large arsenal of upgrade-able weapons and ship powers<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Beautiful HD graphics<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Steam Achievements",
